    "Lease units also need IPAddressDeny=any: in systemd IPAddressAllow=localhost alone restricts nothing (systemd.resource-control(5)); build/07-pz-vstanovlennia.md:532 says localhost only and :534 uses IPAddressDeny=any for decoders.",
    "units.system_unit_paths is the systemd system unit search order (systemd.unit(5)); /run is runtime state and is not inventoried, so the offline lease result covers persistent configuration only (DEVICE row RX-12-runtime).",
    "version_rule require_lab_build: the version must end in the local repository's +labN marker or in the -0labN Debian revision of a locked lab rebuild (gr-satellites 5.10.0~git20260922-0lab1, deployment/sources.lock.json); deployment/deploy.py doctor and selftest.py RX-01a apply the same rule (deploy.version_forbidden).",
    "librtlsdr2 fallback build 2.0.1-2build1+lab1 (build/07-pz-vstanovlennia.md:262) is not allowlisted; the conservative rule allows only 2.0.3-0+lab1 (build/07-pz-vstanovlennia.md:86)."
